# Loxodon Surveyor's max speed ability is its owner's (CR 702.178a: "your speed"; each player has a speed apart, CR 702.179). Bot2 casts the
# Surveyor on turn 2 (speed 1) and Lightning Bolts Bot1's face on each of its turns 2, 4 and 6, raising its speed to 2, 3 and 4 (702.179d), while
# Bot1 never has a speed (it has no permanent with start your engines!). Bot1 Bolts the Surveyor on turn 3, so on turn 4 at speed 3 the graveyard
# card has no ability to activate even with every source untapped; on turn 6 at speed 4 the same activation is offered, {3} exiles the card
# and Bot2 draws Ornithopter after the turn's draw (Memnite).

